    "TitleKey": "headhunters_killship_cfp_vhrt_title_001",
    "Description": "Got a platinum target that needs to get taken down. ~mission(TargetName) is a heavy hitter who's one of the people running security for Citizens for Prosperity. Although ~mission(TargetName|Last) might have forgotten, the Headhunters remember their work with a merc company a few years ago that lead to the deaths of five brothers and sisters. We want blood for blood.\n\nThey've been spotted poking around ~mission(Location|Address), so you should still be able to find them there.\n\nThey're a mean bastard, so bring some friends but make sure they end up dead.\n\nStows out.",
    "DescriptionKey": "headhunters_killship_cfp_vhrt_desc_001",
    "DisplayDescription": "Got a platinum target that needs to get taken down. [TargetName] is a heavy hitter who's one of the people running security for Citizens for Prosperity. Although [TargetName|Last] might have forgotten, the Headhunters remember their work with a merc company a few years ago that lead to the deaths of five brothers and sisters. We want blood for blood.\n\nThey've been spotted poking around [Location|Address], so you should still be able to find them there.\n\nThey're a mean bastard, so bring some friends but make sure they end up dead.\n\nStows out.",
